nce":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Check environment details"],["description","Initially, the malware utilizes API calls such as GetEnvironmentStrings and GetModuleHandleExW to retrieve environment details."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1082"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Terminate on debugger detection"],["description","Subsequently, it triggers a memory access violation exception and terminates the process by calling RtlExitUserProcess if a debugger or analysis environment is detected."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1622"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Decode obfuscated data section"],["description","If the malware doesn\u2019t detect any analysis environment, it proceeds to decode the content of the .data section using bitwise XOR operations:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1140"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Create suspended RegAsm process"],["description","Post decoding the content of the .data section, it proceeds to create a suspended process RegAsm.exe:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1055.012"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Inject code into RegAsm"],["description","Following that, it executes process injection by writing the virtual memory of the suspended process RegAsm.exe with code retrieved from the decoded .data section:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1055"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Resume injected process and exit"],["description","After injecting the code into RegAsm.exe, it resumes the suspended process and subsequently terminates itself:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1055.012"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Retrieve C2 from Steam profile"],["description","At this stage, RegAsm.exe executes the injected code. It establishes a connection to retrieve the C2 information from the URL https[:]//steamcommunity[.]com/profiles/76561199686524322, identified within the extracted string from the decoded content of .data section:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1583.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Use Steam-provided C2 address"],["description","The response body includes the C2 address \u201chttps[:]//65.108.55.55[:]9000\u201d, where it exfiltrates the data from the victim\u2019s PC:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1071.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--180f2983-9c1a-56f4-99d6-c990125f7baa","120":"instance--c7f65318-7600-57f4-a8ac-992357e695ff","150":"instance--95523e1a-0a1d-52ef-944c-23f9cbc50233","180":"instance--bc8eb48d-411d-5877-aa9b-966476b71207","210":"instance--4cc5026e-07f9-5327-9912-5d278a0a3321","240":"instance--d6a7d51d-39a4-5eb3-8831-f23437781b95","270":"instance--cac30e05-5f01-5b4f-b5c0-6b975297df2d","30":"instance--cb0751b0-c027-5895-a460-a72e48920c71","300":"instance--f41cdc1f-abb7-5ff7-81c2-bf2235a7faab","330":"instance--b114cbda-9ec8-5612-b2f8-93c36811cafb","60":"instance--f28e5296-2041-5fe9-992d-4c70d549191e","90":"instance--3ea39244-da0f-5435-8745-f2afa8b13872"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--9","properties":[["name","Download sqlite helper DLL"],["description","It downloads the \u201csqlx[1].dll\u201d in C:\\Users\\user\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\Windows\\INetCache\\IE\\WO8CAGSI directory (\u2018WO8CAGSI\u2018 is a randomly generated directory name) which is a non-malicious sqlite3 binary, that implements a self-contained, serverless, zero-configuration, transactional SQL database engine to help with data harvesting and exfiltration:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--db5fab04-54d4-5eec-a429-185861eb2719","120":"instance--985391bd-d017-5935-ab31-3b4b56331b02","150":"instance--092bb98d-fc30-5f69-b6b7-e3024f3ec65a","180":"instance--755129e6-612e-5b63-a780-1c886d98909b","210":"instance--431723d9-dd8c-5190-9dab-6f346173c044","240":"instance--5b9fb821-54fe-5f22-bba3-038263245910","270":"instance--3c6777cb-6430-544b-b31a-01b198524553","30":"instance--c070071b-a9a3-52fe-8956-a51744db200b","300":"instance--a9a4289c-d995-5783-9544-a8b45052eb56","330":"instance--344009cc-e024-5c68-9246-51e85e00d45c","60":"instance--86c77621-2c1d-59c3-b398-e62f4b48a3dd","90":"instance--67627b08-1913-5f3d-8318-52d3bda9c1c3"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--10","properties":[["name","Retrieve alternate C2 from Telegram"],["description","The malware also initiates another communication request to the URL \u201chttps[:]//t[.]me/k0mono\u201d, which is also found in the decoded content:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1071.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--6b7baffd-afaf-5472-9af2-a263119a77ef","120":"instance--83f38e63-e29a-53f4-99d9-927a195c453f","150":"instance--3e720145-b7a1-5bd6-8a7d-bb13519675d1","180":"instance--bdce060f-d96c-5b06-b8f4-1ab1527fd01d","210":"instance--a4feb251-e6e3-5680-a712-d59c92f73ccf","240":"instance--9a564ca6-b753-5b06-880c-b3aac25c1e73","270":"instance--76861a89-f006-5e0d-8c5b-ebdcb5e926dc","30":"instance--cf41e64d-4a4b-58d9-9962-72d278b2c489","300":"instance--ac1d6edd-482f-5f13-9348-b605afcc260c","330":"instance--ed78dfa1-f300-564f-b2cd-6c99552b9a68","60":"instance--979accb3-1b3e-5af4-9182-78392cbaf904","90":"instance--ae721c42-320e-5ea4-9c77-339a05b6e12f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--11","properties":[["name","Use Telegram-provided C2 address"],["description","The response to this request contains another C2 address \u201chttps[:]//91.107.221.88[:]9000\u201d:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1071.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--f1e35721-7ac2-54fe-bcf6-5456d2faeaa3","120":"instance--3ff6777e-fcba-5b31-bf0f-3ddf77f6030d","150":"instance--cc6192f9-21a5-5d1a-b954-6a52d989b82d","180":"instance--62a87260-0181-5f49-bc05-733216e4d822","210":"instance--2f2d05c5-8e60-5ac2-b7af-e03027d67957","240":"instance--79c1ec18-d792-5d3d-a7bc-d94fe8b124cf","270":"instance--a035d357-e930-5d33-ab8d-d0314092d036","30":"instance--3af551b8-f6ac-5f54-9f6d-403fecdc69eb","300":"instance--298b5d2a-bf93-51e9-b052-19ce36114a5d","330":"instance--c8ea0da0-a19a-5766-b0d1-8524844a59d1","60":"instance--a204f87d-ace7-5a9e-b3d1-13202bdc5c7b","90":"instance--fff4de11-3f84-52c8-bb77-192210612a62"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--12","properties":[["name","Use TLS and detect interception"],["description","All network communication occurs over a secure channel using TLS 1.2. Any attempt to intercept this communication results in the termination of the malicious process, accompanied by the error message \u201cCertificate verify failed: self-signed certificate\u201d:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1587.003"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--cac05670-e90e-512c-99cc-c0adf909c3ef","120":"instance--43922820-ddd3-5742-a88d-49c20f8e3fd5","150":"instance--884271a6-8d7b-5c96-9ece-61be4126898b","180":"instance--373a94ef-653d-5c24-96f7-d0cf326d3aea","210":"instance--e58b782a-e75e-5141-bdf0-6d47dbed96bd","240":"instance--5960e46a-3307-5101-b96f-f1bae10e323d","270":"instance--a5ae1125-6ca5-54f1-b9d3-0091a0a38367","30":"instance--e7c521dd-fe09-528b-bb67-1ec53389b876","300":"instance--582e0864-cb5c-5de1-b6c0-e162ae91e8bc","330":"instance--3d5550f3-3e33-5d71-b71e-db2a0a957e5e","60":"instance--b83fc757-0bd4-5b63-a13e-e5b8ef5956d2","90":"instance--2a745819-837b-5585-a366-81a34117a6e5"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--13","properties":[["name","Collect victim data"],["description","In the final stage, the malicious process begins collecting and exfiltrating data from the victim\u2019s PC. This encompasses data from web browsers, including cookies, history, extensions, login data, session data, and cache. Additionally, it targets cryptocurrency wallets, sensitive files within user directories, and data from the Telegram app:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1555"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2accaaf8-d071-542e-9a10-06866a96b394","120":"instance--75ef5b2f-7c71-566e-baf2-29f54ced8138","150":"instance--73017f0a-a5f3-5dca-b91c-a2d37bcfe21b","180":"instance--2f1b6e5f-d3b0-59e5-b3c8-6c1399d1ce2a","210":"instance--c7aedd91-3346-5b75-9e3a-842851881a25","240":"instance--2146989b-d8a2-53f0-8a1c-cd3d976227e9","270":"instance--1b0bbd91-fa2a-5897-96d0-9e5918961c9c","30":"instance--e6b73353-364e-5586-a07b-e1fdc92ad2d3","300":"instance--0fdc5473-d5b9-5fed-91a3-21958da6287b","330":"instance--fd1cd9e0-5761-5725-801f-bf88b65914e8","60":"instance--a58b8357-6abc-58d7-ad2b-bec48fffcd9b","90":"instance--e8daf33f-0240-5544-9f99-3be7ac96fc1d"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--14","properties":[["name","Read system-specific directories"],["description","It also attempts to read system-specific directories (hiddenwith security descriptors in or system directory) such as $Recycle.Bin, $Windows.~BT, $SysReset using ReadFile operation where C:\\$Directory is the placeholder for a specific directory name:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1083"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--c80ca3ef-db0a-5372-968e-c17eb31a79ca","120":"instance--69989f45-927f-57be-92e5-5102fccd9f11","150":"instance--9b02c549-b183-5406-a100-249fb1868d16","180":"instance--c1d2a890-ed8d-5123-92d5-ceeaa937ee87","210":"instance--b785b7b9-02d5-5d04-be0c-0d02d4f85620","240":"instance--cde2d3fb-a23f-5188-9d7d-6c7f3cd3cebb","270":"instance--3fa59d94-25bb-5c51-af21-1a7c1fd91f66","30":"instance--fdd04191-1a03-5134-b88e-a55240471931","300":"instance--dddeb587-c160-5bdc-a385-f5d294f11e92","330":"instance--a13b6b46-2b8e-5660-b86f-03747a07fe24","60":"instance--d996db22-4d65-536a-83bf-a1db02b37136","90":"instance--258e2cac-1806-5147-8d61-a10d64a86e46"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--15","properties":[["name","Access NTFS security descriptor attribute"],["description","The special NTFS metadata attribute associated with security decriptors in Windows is also accessed by the malware:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0009","technique":"T1005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--878d252f-de04-5857-ad0a-e8560794a9aa","120":"instance--bf65c103-2305-50be-8098-7718a8b010c5","150":"instance--348f71b8-78ee-5edf-accb-cd536c0db67d","180":"instance--e786d536-88e4-5ad4-8526-ae120c505f45","210":"instance--d3f3806c-3238-5b69-a0ca-334a1453e3dd","240":"instance--6dc42515-8e0a-5d8f-9dcb-cc6f0eb80f24","270":"instance--6a335c70-0c01-578c-9e01-614ace562750","30":"instance--c34e4c14-a710-535c-afd4-17d8ea759e88","300":"instance--60b19ce6-d4d3-5ce5-b2fe-3427fd0ea9a4","330":"instance--dea41a44-5c5a-520f-8975-25088fdd166c","60":"instance--e8f2f47b-1824-589b-af23-ab4291258936","90":"instance--67989025-38e3-56c8-b903-f474fc067511"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--16","properties":[["name","Read Jump Lists"],["description","Additionally, it reads Jump Lists, which offer quick access to recently opened files, frequently used programs, and associated tasks:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1217"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--dbfe6415-cd2c-55f2-9509-06b6668ef23a","120":"instance--79ca45e2-afd7-51fa-9574-5085c7de4c84","150":"instance--39171cfe-3bf6-5200-b6f5-e97e3b047db7","180":"instance--8cda146b-7259-56b2-b337-56038a1f52d3","210":"instance--a662f8bf-2723-58c0-a1a8-9af9497cf428","240":"instance--a9b75b15-3be0-5e64-8132-40b87e7ae405","270":"instance--31896ecd-322b-5a41-bd1e-0b7a30b9d9d1","30":"instance--60868276-2726-597d-8f57-8aa7fc9c0738","300":"instance--4f5668fa-b6ef-57cc-93da-5cd1e1727a22","330":"instance--b022a562-9020-587c-a5be-97d254cc8f11","60":"instance--cf452b0f-192e-5357-ba8c-fbae1a6e4ae0","90":"instance--012cc6fc-0a37-5e6e-b9b7-07f3bcd2d02c"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--17","properties":[["name","Read SOFTWARE registry hive file"],["description","It also reads the C:\\Windows\\System32\\config\\SOFTWARE directory, which typically refers to a critical file within the Windows registry on a Windows system:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1012"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a73f63ad-1c10-59c2-82aa-bef4ae8f64e0","120":"instance--62757838-a58e-5d41-b7e3-1ccc64e8cdbf","150":"instance--3462202b-a91d-5325-abfe-876a63049484","180":"instance--72959cd4-5e05-5d69-a145-8b6f35720646","210":"instance--d3b85082-8de6-5ffd-8abe-c9e1ec43f533","240":"instance--0a22ffab-8bbc-55b1-85ec-df74e4a120f6","270":"instance--548b3ba1-955f-5e04-b6e8-064cc259e7a6","30":"instance--6f0a37c5-db81-5459-92c1-bc8ab8cd1fd3","300":"instance--e81be898-f7c2-56a0-a705-d2aba8831f75","330":"instance--8f207ed6-cb63-551c-9a40-583fac14fe80","60":"instance--8b44546f-f8e4-5d12-b172-99f9507395eb","90":"instance--f61db455-1665-504d-85b4-5fd5d40fbcc2"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--18","properties":[["name","Stage collected data in ProgramData"],["description","In addition to these, it also gathers data from the ProgramData folder, process explorer data, and network requests. All this data is compiled into a folder named C:\\ProgramData\\HJJDGHCBGDHI\\ with distinct file names:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0009","technique":"T1074.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--223a73a7-07a6-5688-bc70-e7fbf2c8afd4","120":"instance--2184e59f-b6bd-5ca7-8254-3872e152a964","150":"instance--eed82efc-7573-5ccf-97d8-e3f88a2337bb","180":"instance--453ded0c-8246-59f2-a14f-beca9e751cd6","210":"instance--143e4619-312d-5cbc-acc5-efed5f6c0164","240":"instance--659cf4a8-ca80-5204-8b8d-3240f6f370da","270":"instance--2dac3e32-a8df-582e-845a-3a7b1d510c1d","30":"instance--6ab42faa-5ba5-5c44-b387-40b1d021e500","300":"instance--96e5ad82-e4af-5995-8b69-6df7d7ce2490","330":"instance--a960fdd4-4889-5426-a406-4761d11be5ab","60":"instance--42df375f-d3e2-5d47-9faa-324aecbbf064","90":"instance--51395417-94d2-5b5a-881c-7b6cc63ade4e"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--19","properties":[["name","Lock and unlock staged files"],["description","To restrict access to the collected data solely to itself, the malware employs a technique of repeatedly locking and unlocking the files throughout its operation."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1222"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--25dacfeb-3a3d-51fc-91b7-64ee405fe041","120":"instance--5a984174-ce49-510d-b6b6-d4f0e0ee332f","150":"instance--f2167f56-1cf9-5fea-a726-d003a591d391","180":"instance--70c47af3-1817-5ae2-9f6e-38421d85f808","210":"instance--cfd506cd-f673-5f4f-a5ff-5854ad8a39d5","240":"instance--b78e4cb3-2b2b-5706-8d59-d252dd134505","270":"instance--73410cfd-8533-5545-94b7-c06859fcd4a8","30":"instance--760fe684-ea1e-52a0-87e8-fa0bc5d62d70","300":"instance--fa30f213-64f3-55b5-85cd-9dbf46e0e8dc","330":"instance--0dbe5c9b-c2db-5139-a300-8054f3a8e205","60":"instance--a78137f8-a78e-563e-ad44-749594629166","90":"instance--626b6c26-479d-5895-a619-ee3dbb14136d"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--20","properties":[["name","Exfiltrate and delete collected data"],["description","Once it has gathered the targeted data from the compromised system, it exfiltrates it to the designated C2 server and subsequently deletes the gathered data to eradicate any traces of exfiltration:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0010","technique":"T1041"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--93ee4f51-8321-58fb-b05f-3a6fd3a6a8ab","120":"instance--02ee2d77-fc8c-55cc-8958-e3d0b5ead581","150":"instance--15aaf9f3-3996-5f9b-bee4-47f2963a0df4","180":"instance--1ae13e0a-be4e-5658-ba6d-c941c0d5cafb","210":"instance--87590098-5adb-5af7-aa75-039447d58b2b","240":"instance--87dee187-bf66-5b52-81e0-15b789ab6a7c","270":"instance--25c474c1-a795-5124-95ce-3e6163b067d2","30":"instance--ae371f09-8eae-53a7-a14c-34f9e72904fd","300":"instance--9ecc9c80-603d-5760-b2b6-f850dfd3eddf","330":"instance--b9543d3c-a7f9-50a6-b8a1-3fd4c6dddd56","60":"instance--cba1b44c-d7c9-5ebb-8433-b63b0b91427c","90":"instance--1c5f2ea2-c075-51ba-9f13-69b716c352cf"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--21","properties":[["name","Terminate after exfiltration"],["description","Finally, the malicious process terminates itself after completing the exfiltration process:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1529"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","Subsequently, it triggers a memory access violation exception and terminates the process by calling RtlExitUserProcess if a debugger or analysis environment is detected."]]},{"an